Package: globalkoma
Title: Multi-Country Bayesian Macro Model Built on koma
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Laurent", "Florin", , "laurent.f94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data pipeline and modelling code for a multi-country Bayesian
    simultaneous-equations macro model, built on top of the 'koma' package.
    Stage 1 estimates per-country satellite models, stage 2 assembles the
    joint multi-country system of equations, and stage 3 builds regional
    (euro-area) and global aggregation blocks. Orchestrated with 'targets';
    library management with 'renv'.
